sequenceDiagram
  participant API
  participant R as Replanning
  participant DB
  participant V as Voyage/Capacity
  participant O as Outbox
  participant Broker
  participant C as Consumer
  API->>R: Start / receive disruption
  R->>V: Reserve new capacity
  V->>DB: Atomic update + reservation COMMIT
  Note over R: CRASH before process-state update
  R--xAPI: process dies
  API->>R: Worker restarts
  R->>DB: load durable process
  R->>V: idempotent reserve check
  R->>DB: reassign + release + complete
  R->>O: store BookingReplanned atomically
  O->>Broker: publish
  Note over O,Broker: crash here may cause duplicate publication
  Broker->>C: duplicate delivery possible
  C->>DB: Inbox uniqueness
